  "interpretation": [
    "All three seeds completed. S577 best minus its actual frozen Lbest parent: AbsRel -0.000289166 (scene CI [-0.000392163,-0.000189916]); RMSE, delta1 and boundary-band error improve in the first two seeds, while seed320114 is exactly the parent at best step0. Boundary F1 decreases by 0.005724019 on average, with two negative seeds and one exact tie.",
    "Compared with J577 validation-selected best, S577 has higher mean AbsRel (+0.001655570, CI [0.000893598,0.002440986]), lower F1 and higher boundary-band error; seed directions are mixed. RMSE/delta1 intervals include zero. This is not a test-driven change of selected weights.",
    "All S577 own stages meet the predeclared stable criterion from step0 because they start from a trained parent. Best steps are1000/800/0, stopping steps1100/1000/1000. Total cost includes full L training and selection; it is not zero-cost convergence.",
    "Best-to-final AbsRel/RMSE/delta1 mean-change intervals include zero. F1 and band changes are mixed across seeds; a small final AbsRel advantage must not replace validation-selected best.",
